        <h1>AI for <em>Trades and Field Services</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A plain-English playbook for plumbers, electricians, HVAC, and field crews run from a van and a phone. The uses that actually pay off, how to stop missing calls, quoting faster without losing money, and the tools to skip.</p>
